    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Live sandboxes by provider",
      "description": "Non-terminal sandbox rows that are pending, starting or ready. A minute on each provider is bought at a different price, which is why this is tagged by provider and not by tenant. Per-account spend is a database report rather than a series; the console has it under sandbox spend.",
